1-
/etc/hosts dosyasına spark-master ve spark-worker-0 eklenir.

spark-master (10.0.0.10) → controller + broker, portlar: 9093 (controller), 9092 (broker)
spark-worker-0 (10.0.0.11) → broker, port: 9092
/etc/hosts her iki makinede birbiriyle çözülebilmeli:

10.0.0.10  spark-master
10.0.0.11  spark-worker-0


